  id: 2
  displayName: Asseria
  displayBio: "On the outskirts of the city of Ektrell, in the fifth district of
    the planet Symperion, inside the IUA Chapel of Consciousness, the gathered young
    Hya-Tu'ah (Kerranian, roughly \"Destined to Die\") prepare alongside the priests
    for the annual rite of bodily sacrifice. Asseria, one of the chosen offerings\u2014taken
    as a child from her homeworld of Jierra by the Aktta Sutrte, warriors of the
    clan\u2014prays to her goddess for a swift and painless death. As the priests
    drain the blood from Asseria\u2019s body, she utters the mantra Opta Entris with
    her dying breath. When she closes her eyes, fire appears in the darkness\u2014a
    fire that will burn all of Symperion to ashes."
  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 12a998e1e9891bb408df09f3fda7d959, type: 3}
